    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0529" n="435" sameAs="frus:frus1924v02/pg435"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/26844: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Consul at Vera Cruz</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wood</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-01-23T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                                1924—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Report immediately when all mines have been removed from ports mentioned in your
                    January 23, 9 a.m.; also ascertain whether there <pb facs="0530" n="436"
                        xml:id="pg436"/> are any other ports where mines have been placed and if so,
                    whether these will also be removed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
